 a Python module.
 
+The ``is_pre_built`` hook is version-aware.  It is called with ``version``
+and ``variant`` only when a version is known, such as in the START phase.
+A non-``None`` return value overrides the YAML ``pre_built`` settings,
+including version-specific ones.  Returning ``None`` defers to YAML.  The
+hook is not called when no version is given, so the variant default is
+used.
+
+.. versionadded:: 0.95.0
+
 See :doc:`/reference/hooks` for the complete list of hooks and their
 arguments.
 
