@@ -122,4 +122,35 @@ adds variant awareness, patch discovery, and template resolution.
      - Build tag (from changelog length), annotations, PURL config,
        pyproject.toml overrides
 
+Version-Specific Pre-Built Settings
+-----------------------------------
+
+.. versionadded:: 0.95.0
+
+``pre_built`` and ``wheel_server_url`` can be overridden per package
+version under ``variants.<variant>.versions.<version>``.  Without a
+version, ``PackageBuildInfo.pre_built`` and
+``PackageBuildInfo.wheel_server_url`` return the variant defaults.  With
+a version, ``is_pre_built()`` and ``get_wheel_server_url()`` apply the
+override, falling back to the variant default for any field left unset.
+A local version segment is ignored, so ``2.8.0+cpu`` uses the ``2.8.0``
+entry.
+
+The START phase runs after the version is known.  If the version's
+``pre_built`` differs from the variant default, or a pre-built version
+has its own ``wheel_server_url``, the download URL is resolved again for
+that version and build kind.  If nothing matches, the original URL is
+kept and a warning is logged.
+
+::
+
+   variants:
+     cpu:
+       pre_built: false
+       wheel_server_url: https://wheel.example.com/simple
+       versions:
+         "2.9.0":
+           pre_built: true
+           wheel_server_url: https://gitlab.example.com/simple
+
 See :doc:`/reference/config-reference` for the full field reference.
